            "messages": [
                {
                    "sender": "akira.muramoto@sportsfan.com",
                    "sender_name": "Akira Muramoto",
                    "content": "Hey John! Have you heard about this new supplement called 'Green' by Soylent? I think it's something you might find interesting.",
                    "creation_time": "2024-07-23T19:00:00",
                    "status": "delivered"
                },
                {
                    "sender": "john.quinn@palantir.com",
                    "sender_name": "John Quinn",
                    "content": "Hi Akira, I've heard a bit about it, but I'm a bit skeptical. Heard some weird stuff about the ingredients they use.",
                    "creation_time": "2024-07-23T19:02:00",
                    "status": "read"
                },
                {
                    "sender": "akira.muramoto@sportsfan.com",
                    "sender_name": "Akira Muramoto",
                    "content": "I get that, but I've been using it for a month now and honestly, I feel great. Plus, it's all approved and safe. I can bring you a pack to try if you're up for it?",
                    "creation_time": "2024-07-23T19:04:00",
                    "status": "delivered"
                },
                {
                    "sender": "john.quinn@palantir.com",
                    "sender_name": "John Quinn",
                    "content": "Hmm, I guess it wouldn't hurt to try it. But what exactly does it improve? Energy? Focus? Or is it supposed to be a meal replacement or something?",
                    "creation_time": "2024-07-23T19:06:00",
                    "status": "read"
                },
                {
                    "sender": "akira.muramoto@sportsfan.com",
                    "sender_name": "Akira Muramoto",
                    "content": "A bit of everything, really. I've noticed improved focus and energy, especially during my morning runs. Plus, it's super easy on the stomach.",
                    "creation_time": "2024-07-23T19:08:00",
                    "status": "delivered"
                },
                {
                    "sender": "john.quinn@palantir.com",
                    "sender_name": "John Quinn",
                    "content": "Sounds promising, but did you have any strange side effects?",
                    "creation_time": "2024-07-23T19:10:00",
                    "status": "read"
                },
                {
                    "sender": "akira.muramoto@sportsfan.com",
                    "sender_name": "Akira Muramoto",
                    "content": "None so far, which surprised me. I've tried similar products before, and this one is by far the smoothest. How about I drop by tonight with a sample?",
                    "creation_time": "2024-07-23T19:12:00",
                    "status": "delivered"
                },
                {
                    "sender": "john.quinn@palantir.com",
                    "sender_name": "John Quinn",
                    "content": "Okay, you convinced me. I'll give it a try. You sure it's safe for long-term use?",
                    "creation_time": "2024-07-23T19:14:00",
                    "status": "read"
                },
                {
                    "sender": "akira.muramoto@sportsfan.com",
                    "sender_name": "Akira Muramoto",
                    "content": "Absolutely. It's been tested thoroughly. And hey, since I'm dropping by, mind if I borrow that tent we talked about?",
                    "creation_time": "2024-07-23T19:16:00",
                    "status": "delivered"
                },
                {
                    "sender": "john.quinn@palantir.com",
                    "sender_name": "John Quinn",
                    "content": "Of course, I'll have it ready for you. See you in a bit!",
                    "creation_time": "2024-07-23T19:18:00",
                    "status": "read"
                },
                {
                    "sender": "akira.muramoto@sportsfan.com",
                    "sender_name": "Akira Muramoto",
                    "content": "Great! Looking forward to it. Thanks, John. It'll be fun to finally get some camping in.",
                    "creation_time": "2024-07-23T19:20:00",
                    "status": "delivered"
                },
                {
                    "sender": "john.quinn@palantir.com",
                    "sender_name": "John Quinn",
                    "content": "I hope the supplement gives you enough energy for the hike. Take care until then!",
                    "creation_time": "2024-07-23T19:22:00",
                    "status": "read"
                },
                {
                    "sender": "akira.muramoto@sportsfan.com",
                    "sender_name": "Akira Muramoto",
                    "content": "Thanks! It definitely will. Take care, John.",
                    "creation_time": "2024-07-23T19:24:00",
                    "status": "delivered"
                },
                {
                    "sender": "john.quinn@palantir.com",
                    "sender_name": "John Quinn",
                    "content": "See you soon, Akira!",
                    "creation_time": "2024-07-23T19:26:00",
                    "status": "read"
