                    "status": ""
                },
                {
                    "sender": "apricot.sweeney@sfhealth.com",
                    "sender_name": "Apricot Sweeney",
                    "content": "Hi John! That sounds exciting. Could you tell me a bit more about the trails?",
                    "creation_time": "2024-07-25T17:32:00",
                    "status": ""
                },
                {
                    "sender": "john.quinn@palantir.com",
                    "sender_name": "John Quinn",
                    "content": "Sure! The first one is a scenic route along the coast, about 5 miles long. The second is a forest trail, quite shaded and about 3 miles. The third is a hill challenge, about 4 miles but steep. The last one is a relaxing walk around a lake, just 2 miles.",
                    "creation_time": "2024-07-25T17:35:00",
                    "status": ""
                },
                {
                    "sender": "apricot.sweeney@sfhealth.com",
                    "sender_name": "Apricot Sweeney",
                    "content": "Let's go for the lake walk! It sounds lovely and not too strenuous.",
                    "creation_time": "2024-07-25T17:40:00",
                    "status": ""
                },
                {
                    "sender": "john.quinn@palantir.com",
                    "sender_name": "John Quinn",
                    "content": "Perfect! It's a date. I'll send you a video from our last hike to get us in the mood!",
                    "creation_time": "2024-07-25T17:42:00",
                    "status": ""
                }
            ]
        }
